{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30971","headline":"应举日寄兄弟 · 朱可名","name":"应举日寄兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"废刈镜湖田，上书紫阁前。\n愁人久委地，诗道未闻天。\n不是烧金手，徒抛钓月船。\n多惭兄弟意，不敢问林泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱可名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}